    { "id": "pentax-reversal-film", "name": "Pentax Reversal Film", "name_zh": "宾得 反转片", "group": "pentax", "engine": "recipe-lab", "source": "authored-here", "tone": "color", "verified": false, "note": "本仓库自写，模拟宾得 Custom Image「Reversal Film」。官方描述：黑位深、靠反差而非饱和度还原反转片的浓郁色彩——所以只加一档饱和，反差拉满，DRO 关死。不含任何第三方 LUT 数据。未在实机验证。", "recipe": { "style": "VIVID", "sat": 1, "con": 3, "sharp": 1, "matrix": 0, "wb": { "mode": "AUTO", "kelvin": 0, "ab": 0, "gm": 0 }, "pe": 0, "sub": 0, "ev": 0, "dro": 0 } },
    { "id": "pentax-satobi", "name": "Pentax Satobi", "name_zh": "宾得 Satobi", "group": "pentax", "engine": "recipe-lab", "source": "authored-here", "tone": "color", "verified": false, "note": "本仓库自写，模拟宾得 Custom Image「Satobi」。官方描述：60-70 年代彩色照片的青蓝、暗黄与褪色红，适合人像。NEUTRAL 底压饱和、白平衡向绿偏一点制造旧青调。不含任何第三方 LUT 数据。未在实机验证。", "recipe": { "style": "NEUTRAL", "sat": -2, "con": 0, "sharp": -1, "matrix": 0, "wb": { "mode": "AUTO", "kelvin": 0, "ab": 0, "gm": -1 }, "pe": 0, "sub": 0, "ev": 0, "dro": 4 } },
    { "id": "pentax-katen", "name": "Pentax Katen (summer sky)", "name_zh": "宾得 夏空 Katen", "group": "pentax", "engine": "recipe-lab", "source": "authored-here", "tone": "color", "verified": false, "note": "本仓库自写，模拟宾得特别版 Custom Image「KATEN（夏空）」。官方描述：强调夏季天空的浓郁蓝与耀眼的白云细节，强光下反差戏剧化。LANDSCAPE 风格强化蓝天。不含任何第三方 LUT 数据。未在实机验证。", "recipe": { "style": "LANDSCAPE", "sat": 1, "con": 2, "sharp": 0, "matrix": 0, "wb": { "mode": "AUTO", "kelvin": 0, "ab": 0, "gm": 0 }, "pe": 0, "sub": 0, "ev": 0, "dro": 1 } },
    { "id": "pentax-kyushu", "name": "Pentax Kyushu (nine autumns)", "name_zh": "宾得 九州 Kyushu", "group": "pentax", "engine": "recipe-lab", "source": "authored-here", "tone": "color", "verified": false, "note": "本仓库自写，模拟宾得特别版 Custom Image「KYUSHU（九州）」。官方描述：秋意的红调蓝与深绿，季节流逝感。AUTUMN 风格打底，反差与饱和都收一点。不含任何第三方 LUT 数据。未在实机验证。", "recipe": { "style": "AUTUMN", "sat": -1, "con": -1, "sharp": 0, "matrix": 0, "wb": { "mode": "AUTO", "kelvin": 0, "ab": 1, "gm": 0 }, "pe": 0, "sub": 0, "ev": 0, "dro": 4 } },
    { "id": "pentax-fuyuno", "name": "Pentax Fuyuno (winter field)", "name_zh": "宾得 冬野 Fuyuno", "group": "pentax", "engine": "recipe-lab", "source": "authored-here", "tone": "color", "verified": false, "note": "本仓库自写，模拟宾得特别版 Custom Image「FUYUNO（冬野）」。官方描述：高调锐利、饱和收敛、偏红的枯叶色与微微泛蓝的白色，冬日弱光的观感。不含任何第三方 LUT 数据。未在实机验证。", "recipe": { "style": "LIGHT", "sat": -1, "con": -1, "sharp": 1, "matrix": 0, "wb": { "mode": "AUTO", "kelvin": 0, "ab": 0, "gm": 0 }, "pe": 0, "sub": 0, "ev": 1, "dro": 6 } },
    { "id": "pentax-harubeni", "name": "Pentax Harubeni (spring rouge)", "name_zh": "宾得 春红 Harubeni", "group": "pentax", "engine": "recipe-lab", "source": "authored-here", "tone": "color", "verified": false, "note": "本仓库自写，模拟宾得特别版 Custom Image「HARUBENI（春红）」。官方描述：强调樱花的粉色与春霞天空的收敛蓝，色相向红偏移、反差提高但保留花瓣的柔感。不含任何第三方 LUT 数据。未在实机验证。", "recipe": { "style": "PORTRAIT", "sat": -1, "con": 1, "sharp": -1, "matrix": 0, "wb": { "mode": "AUTO", "kelvin": 0, "ab": 1, "gm": 1 }, "pe": 0, "sub": 0, "ev": 0, "dro": 4 } },
