    { "id": "toy-camera-warm", "name": "Toy Camera (warm)", "name_zh": "玩具相机·暖", "group": "app-look", "engine": "recipe-lab", "source": "authored-here", "tone": "color", "verified": false, "note": "本仓库自写。手机滤镜 App 里最常见的「暗角 + 偏色 + 轻微过曝」组合，在 a6000 上唯一能沾边的就是索尼的 pe=1 玩具相机（自带暗角与偏色，sub=2 取暖调）。注意：这是近似，不是漏光——设置存储区里没有叠加层。pe 生效时相机会忽略创意风格，所以 sat/con/sharp 一律记 0。未在实机验证。", "recipe": { "style": "STD", "sat": 0, "con": 0, "sharp": 0, "matrix": 0, "wb": { "mode": "AUTO", "kelvin": 0, "ab": 2, "gm": 0 }, "pe": 1, "sub": 2, "ev": 1, "dro": 6 } },
    { "id": "toy-camera-cool", "name": "Toy Camera (cool)", "name_zh": "玩具相机·冷", "group": "app-look", "engine": "recipe-lab", "source": "authored-here", "tone": "color", "verified": false, "note": "本仓库自写。与 toy-camera-warm 同一效果、sub=1 取冷调，配合 ab-1 把整体再往蓝端推一点。pe 生效时创意风格被忽略，sat/con/sharp 记 0。未在实机验证。", "recipe": { "style": "STD", "sat": 0, "con": 0, "sharp": 0, "matrix": 0, "wb": { "mode": "AUTO", "kelvin": 0, "ab": -1, "gm": 0 }, "pe": 1, "sub": 1, "ev": 0, "dro": 6 } },
    { "id": "part-color-red", "name": "Part Color (red)", "name_zh": "局部色彩·红", "group": "app-look", "engine": "recipe-lab", "source": "authored-here", "tone": "color", "verified": false, "note": "本仓库自写。手机 App 的「只保留红色、其余去色」在相机里只有 pe=6 局部色彩能办到（sub=0 取红）。全库此前没有任何配方用过 pe=6。pe 生效时创意风格被忽略。未在实机验证。", "recipe": { "style": "STD", "sat": 0, "con": 0, "sharp": 0, "matrix": 0, "wb": { "mode": "AUTO", "kelvin": 0, "ab": 0, "gm": 0 }, "pe": 6, "sub": 0, "ev": 0, "dro": 6 } },
    { "id": "posterization-color", "name": "Posterization (color)", "name_zh": "海报化·彩色", "group": "app-look", "engine": "recipe-lab", "source": "authored-here", "tone": "color", "verified": false, "note": "本仓库自写。色阶分离带来的扁平插画感，对应 pe=3 海报化（sub=0 取彩色版）。全库此前未使用 pe=3。pe 生效时创意风格被忽略。未在实机验证。", "recipe": { "style": "STD", "sat": 0, "con": 0, "sharp": 0, "matrix": 0, "wb": { "mode": "AUTO", "kelvin": 0, "ab": 0, "gm": 0 }, "pe": 3, "sub": 0, "ev": 0, "dro": 6 } },
    { "id": "teal-mood", "name": "Teal Mood", "name_zh": "青调", "group": "app-look", "engine": "recipe-lab", "source": "authored-here", "tone": "color", "verified": false, "note": "本仓库自写。手机 App 常见的青橙冷调，在 a6000 上做不到真正的分色调（没有曲线、只有全局 ab/gm），这里给的是一个干净的全局偏青：ab-2 往蓝、gm+1 往绿、NEUTRAL 底降饱和 3 档。与 gr-cross-process（偏绿品红、强反差）是两种不同的偏色。未在实机验证。", "recipe": { "style": "NEUTRAL", "sat": -3, "con": 0, "sharp": 0, "matrix": 0, "wb": { "mode": "AUTO", "kelvin": 0, "ab": -2, "gm": 1 }, "pe": 0, "sub": 0, "ev": 0, "dro": 6 } },

